WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.924
- When is the last 
time you were afraid?

00:00:02.924 --> 00:00:04.571
- I'm afraid every day.

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:05.672
- What are you afraid of?

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.074
- The health and 
well-being of my family.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:09.743
And I mean for real.

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:11.311
I'm actually more scared

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.579
than almost anybody I know.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:13.947
I've never been 
scared in business.

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:15.382
- You're neurotic?

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:17.150
- I'm just genuinely 
concerned about

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.819
the health and
well-being of my family.

00:00:18.819 --> 00:00:20.220
- What are you afraid of?

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.154
- Them dying.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.890
I love them very, very much.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.224
I'm being very serious with you.

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:26.260
Like work, never.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.294
- Doesn't stress you out?

00:00:27.294 --> 00:00:28.562
- Of course not because

00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:30.964
like being the best basketball
player in the world

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.366
or at least an All-Star,

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:33.800
it's what I do.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.168
It's what I'm great at.

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:36.870
It's my natural gift.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.305
I'll always win in that.

00:00:38.305 --> 00:00:39.573
That's a foregone conclusion.

00:00:39.573 --> 00:00:41.742
Whether somebody on 
the other side of this lens

00:00:41.742 --> 00:00:42.943
likes that or not.

00:00:42.943 --> 00:00:45.245
I'm gonna win professionally.

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:47.748
What I'm scared of 
is what I can't control.

00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:49.116
And the only thing I care about

00:00:49.116 --> 00:00:51.485
that I can't control is the
health and well-being

00:00:51.485 --> 00:00:53.997
of my family and 
closest friends.

00:00:53.997 --> 00:00:54.888
- Okay--

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.823
- And I'm genuinely 
scared of it by the way.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:57.491
- You are?

00:00:57.491 --> 00:01:00.394
- Like it's a thing that crosses
my mind almost daily.

00:01:00.394 --> 00:01:02.195
A phone call or text

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:05.197
that isn't interesting at all.

00:01:05.197 --> 00:01:06.199
And, you know what?

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:08.304
I'm gonna go 
weirdly the other way,

00:01:08.304 --> 00:01:10.804
it is the driver 
of my happiness.

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:13.206
Because every second 
it's not happening

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:16.381
I'm super pumped.

00:01:16.381 --> 00:01:17.144
I mean it.

00:01:17.144 --> 00:01:18.111
- Oh, I believe it.

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:20.430
- It's very binary for me.

